<p>A sunrise boat ride, a walk through the old city and an evening beside the Ganga can each reveal a different side of Varanasi. Add a food walk, a weaving visit or a private musical performance, and your visit becomes more personal.</p>
<p>When planning your budget, it helps to understand exactly what each experience includes. A <strong>Varanasi boat ride price</strong> covering a private motorboat and an English-speaking guide is different from a boat-only quotation. Similarly, a guided food tour includes arrangements that an ordinary sightseeing walk may not.</p>
<p>At Tour Varanasi, our private guided walks start from <strong>₹1,500 per person</strong>, a sunrise boat experience with a guide starts from <strong>₹3,250 per person</strong>, and a food walk with selected vegetarian tastings starts from <strong>₹2,750 per person</strong>.</p>
<p>The guide below explains our starting prices and helps you choose experiences around your interests.</p>
